Revision history for Alien-TinyCDB

{{$NEXT}}
    - Share build fetches a pinned TinyCDB release (0.81) over https and
      verifies its SHA256 digest
    - Share build compiles libcdb.a with -fPIC so XS consumers can link it
      into a shared object
    - A failing shared-library build (non-GNU linker) no longer breaks the
      static build; dynamic_libs is empty there

